### List regions
GET http://localhost:4000/api/regions

### List case data
GET http://localhost:4000/api/cases

### Get predictions for region 1 (hybrid model's latest run)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/predictions/1

### Compare models (hybrid vs baselines)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/models/compare

### List alerts
GET http://localhost:4000/api/alerts

### Login (seeded demo user)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@dews.local",
  "password": "password123"
}
